flowchart LR
  W[Working tree<br/>edit files] -->|git add| I[Index / staging area]
  I -->|git commit| C[Local commit history]
  C --> L[Your local branch]
  L -->|git push| R[Hosted repository<br/>GitHub / GitLab / Bitbucket]
  R -->|git fetch| T[Remote-tracking ref<br/>origin/main, last fetched view]
  T -. git merge or rebase .-> L
